cla A, Plaza Del Sol 3era Sección, Querétaro, Querétaro 76040","map_addr_1":"1001 Carretera A Huimilpan","map_addr_2":"Subancla A","map_city_state_zip":"Plaza Del Sol 3era Sección, Querétaro, Querétaro 76040","grid_brand":"Planet Fitness","location_created_at":"2025-09-22 16:45:31","active_lease_count_over_time":50597,"location_count_over_time":57478,"remaining_rent_liability_over_time":50597}'::jsonb);
